# Written in the Stars (Windurst 3-2, mission.windurst.written_in_the_stars). A level 30 Warrior of Windurst in Heaven's
# Tower with the mission current, To Each His Own Right completed (a GM; a GM's Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1 out).
# Status 0: Kiwawa and Nebibi answer their own defaults 58 and 68; Kupipi 120; Zubaba 121, whose finish gives the Charm
# of Light and sets status 1. Status 1: Zubaba 122, Kiwawa 124, Nebibi 134. Inner Horutoto Ruins: the Gate of Light _5ci
# plays 41 with the charm in slot 1, whose finish takes the charm and sets status 2; at status 2 the gate answers its
# own message. Back in Heaven's Tower: Kiwawa his own 58; Zubaba 135, whose finish completes the mission (400 rank
# points) and adds 100 more (500). Section 1 (completed, A New Journey not): Kiwawa 138, Nebibi 147, Zubaba 136 over
# their defaults.
lists HeavensTower/Kiwawa/onTrigger HeavensTower/Nebibi/onTrigger HeavensTower/Zubaba/onTrigger HeavensTower/Zubaba/onTrade HeavensTower/Kupipi/onTrigger HeavensTower/onEventFinish/121 HeavensTower/onEventFinish/135 HeavensTower/onEventFinish/151 HeavensTower/onEventFinish/257 PortWindurst/onEventFinish/78 WindurstWalls/onEventFinish/93 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/111 WindurstWoods/Rakoh_Buuma/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Sola_Jaab/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Tih_Pikeh/onTrigger WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/114 InnerHorutotoRuins/_5ci/onTrigger InnerHorutotoRuins/onEventFinish/41
char zone=HeavensTower pos=15,-26,18 job=WAR lvl=30 nation=2
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Windurst TheHorutotoRuinsExperiment completed
mission Windurst TheHeartOfTheMatter completed
mission Windurst ThePriceOfPeace completed
mission Windurst LostForWords completed
mission Windurst ATestingTime completed
mission Windurst TheThreeKingdoms completed
mission Windurst ToEachHisOwnRight completed
mission Windurst WrittenInTheStars current
login
trigger Kiwawa                          # status 0: nothing from the mission
finish-if-event
trigger Nebibi
finish-if-event
trigger Kupipi+1                        # 120
finish-if-event
trigger Zubaba                          # 121
finish                                  # the Charm of Light, status 1
trigger Zubaba                          # 122
finish-if-event
trigger Kiwawa                          # 124
finish-if-event
trigger Nebibi                          # 134
finish-if-event
warp -331,0,139 InnerHorutotoRuins
trigger _5ci                            # 41
finish                                  # status 2, the charm taken
trigger _5ci                            # status 2: nothing from the mission
finish-if-event
warp 15,-26,18 HeavensTower
trigger Kiwawa                          # status 2: nothing from the mission
finish-if-event
trigger Zubaba                          # 135
finish                                  # completed, 100 rank points more
trigger Kiwawa                          # section 1, completed: 138
finish-if-event
trigger Nebibi                          # 147
finish-if-event
trigger Zubaba                          # 136
finish-if-event
